{\Large\bfseries Response to Prior Reviews}
\end{center}

We sincerely thank the reviewers for their careful reading and
constructive feedback. We have substantially revised the manuscript
to address the concerns raised in the previous review round.
The major changes include adding a new non-throughput-centric
downstream task, clarifying the RAN-specific motivation and design
rationale of RAN-NFM, strengthening the explanation of the LLM-based
branch, and clarifying several modeling and evaluation choices.
Below, we respond to each comment in detail.

